# Local runtime state. The seeded SQLite file is committed on purpose so a
# fresh clone (or a serverless deploy) boots with a populated marketplace;
# sidecars and scratch data are not.
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
data/private/**
!data/private/.gitkeep
# Generated derivatives are committed so a fresh clone (and the serverless
# bundle) serves real imagery without a build step. Regenerate with
# `npm run db:images`.
